`memmove(&page_map[i+1], &page_map[i], (page_map.len - 1 - i) * sizeof(page_map[0]))` copies `page_map.len - 1 - i` entries from `page_map[i]` to `page_map[i+1]`. So it copies entries `i, i+1, ..., page_map.len-2` to `i+1, i+2, ..., page_map.len-1`. So `page_map[page_map.len-1]` gets the value of `page_map[page_map.len-2]`. And `page_map[i]` is set to `map`.

